<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How this website handles data and privacy" pubDate={new Date('2026-01-20')}>
	<p>
		This site uses Google Analytics (gtag.js, ID G-XDK8RXWSLW) to understand traffic and reader
		trends. No personally identifiable information is actively collected.
	</p>
	<p>
		This site displays content-relevant ads through Google AdSense (publisher ID
		pub-2275368667168938). AdSense and its partners use cookies to serve ads. You can opt out
		of personalized ads at https://adssettings.google.com.
	</p>
	<p>
		Third-party vendors and data use: apart from the Google services above, this site runs no
		other analytics or advertising scripts. When serving ads, Google and its partners may use
		cookies, web beacons, and IP addresses to measure ad performance and — where permitted by
		law and unless you opt out — to show personalized ads based on your visits to this and
		other sites.
	</p>
	<p>
		Controlling cookies: you can disable or delete cookies at any time in your browser
		settings; the site remains fully browsable, though ads may become less relevant. You can
		manage personalized ads at https://adssettings.google.com, and manage third-party vendor
		choices at https://www.aboutads.info/choices or https://www.youronlinechoices.com.
	</p>
	<p>
		EEA and UK visitors: where required by law, this site asks for your consent before showing
		personalized ads. You can change or withdraw your choice at any time via the consent
		banner.
	</p>
	<p>
		Data retention: Google Analytics data is retained according to Google's default retention
		period (typically up to 14 months). This site does not store additional access logs
		server-side.
	</p>
	<p>
		This site is written for adult professionals, is not directed at children, and does not
		knowingly collect information from children. If this policy changes materially, it will be
		updated on this page with a revised date.
	</p>
	<p>
		This site does not sell your personal information. To request deletion or correction,
		please contact me using the email listed in the site header.
	</p>
</Layout>
